[{"author":"dana@acme.example","body":"Hi team — we've grown from 12 to 40 seats over the last quarter and our contract renews this Friday. Can we jump on a call tomorrow to discuss volume pricing and the enterprise tier? Our CFO wants a signed SOW by EOD Thursday. Happy to share our usage report if that helps scope the renewal.\n\nThanks,\nDana — VP Ops, Acme Corp","id":"E1","subject":"Renewal — expanding to 40 seats?","time":"18:42","topic":"sales","thread_id":"renewal-acme","priority":"P2"},{"author":"newsletter@devweekly.example","body":"Your weekly roundup of dev tool news and links.\n\n1. New Python 3.13 features you should know about\n2. Top 10 VS Code extensions for 2026\n3. How we cut our CI time by 40%\n\nUnsubscribe: https://devweekly.example/unsub","id":"E2","subject":"This week in dev tools","time":"19:05","topic":"noise","thread_id":"newsletter-devweekly"},{"author":"sam@brightco.example","[{"author":"dana@acme.example","body":"Hi team — we've grown from 12 to 40 seats over the last que page just loops back to the login screen after authenticating with our IdP. This affects two users right now (myself and maria@brightco.example). We have a client demo at 10am tomorrow and need access before then.\n\nOur SSO provider is Okta, tenant: brightco-prod. Last successful login was yesterday at 17:42 PT.\n\nThanks,\nSam — Engineering Lead, BrightCo","id":"E3","subject":"Can't log in since yesterday","time":"20:17","topic":"support","thread_id":"login-loop-brightco","priority":"P1"},{"author":"lee@shopmart.example","body":"Hi — our finance team just pulled the March statements and we were charged twice for the same plan ($299 × 2 on March 15). The duplicate charge is on card ending 4821. We have a board review Thursday and need this corrected before then.\n\nPlease confirm the refund timeline.\n\nLee — Finance Director, ShopMart","id":"E4","subject":"Charged twice for March invoice","time":"21:03","topic":"billing","thread_id":"double-charge-shopmart","priority":"P2"},{"author":"pat@retailer.example","body":"URGENT — our customers are hitting a 502 Bad Gateway at the payment step of checkout. This started around 2:14am and we've already lost an estimated $12k in abandoned carts. Our Black Friday-level sale starts at 8am and checkout is the only path. This is our highest priority.\n\nAffected endpoints:\n- POST /api/v2/checkout/confirm → 502\n- GET /api/v2/orders/recent → timeout\n\nPlease escalate immediately.\nPat — Head of E-commerce, Retailer Inc.","id":"E5","subject":"Checkout failed at payment step","time":"02:16","topic":"incident","thread_id":"payments-outage","priority":"P0"},{"author":"jo@boutique.example","body":"Every payment attempt is returning a 502 error since about 2am. We're a small boutique and this is our biggest revenue window. Customers are calling our support line directly now. Can you please check the payments service? We're on the Pro plan.\n\nJo — Owner, Boutique Styles","id":"E6","subject":"Payment page returns 502","time":"02:22","topic":"incident","thread_id":"payments-outage","priority":"P0"},{"author":"kim@storefront.example","body":"Our entire checkout is down. The morning flash sale starts at 8am and we have 3,000 people on our waitlist. If checkout isn't working by then we lose the campaign. We've already had 47 cart abandonments in the last hour with 502 errors at payment.\n\nPlease treat this as critical.\nKim — CTO, Storefront Digital","id":"E7","subject":"Urgent: checkout down for our store","time":"02:31","topic":"incident","thread_id":"payments-outage","priority":"P0"},{"author":"sam@brightco.example","body":"Following up on my earlier message — still completely locked out. Maria also can't get in. We tried clearing cookies, different browsers, incognito mode — nothing works. The SSO redirect loops every single time. Our 10am client demo is in 7 hours.\n\nCan someone please look at this?\n\nSam — Engineering Lead, BrightCo","id":"E8","subject":"Still locked out (login loop)","time":"03:10","topic":"support","thread_id":"login-loop-brightco","priority":"P0"},{"author":"founder@tinyagency.example","body":"Hey — we're a 6-person agency reselling SaaS tools to small businesses. We've been recommending your platform to our clients and would love to explore a formal partnership. We could bring 20-30 new accounts per quarter. Are you open to a partner program chat next week?\n\nBest,\nAlex — Founder, Tiny Agency","id":"E9","subject":"Partnership idea","time":"04:45","topic":"general","thread_id":"partnership-tinyagency"},{"author":"ops@foodchain.example","body":"Hi — our accounting department needs a copy of the April invoice (INV-2026-04-001) for their records. The original email may have been caught in spam. Can you resend it to this address and to billing@foodchain.example?\n\nThanks,\nOps Team — FreshFood Chain","id":"E10","subject":"Invoice copy for April?","time":"05:20","topic":"billing","thread_id":"invoice-copy-foodchain"},{"author":"it@lawfirm.example","body":"Hello — we're a 15-person law firm looking to evaluate your platform for our case management team. We'd like a live demo this week if possible. Key requirements: SSO (we use Azure AD), audit logging, and data residency in the US. Our managing partner is available Wednesday or Thursday afternoon.\n\nRegards,\nIT Department — Morrison & Associates LLP","id":"E11","subject":"Demo request — 15-person law firm","time":"06:05","topic":"sales","thread_id":"demo-lawfirm","priority":"P3"},{"author":"events@conf.example","body":"Exhibit at MegaConf — booth discount ends soon. Limited-time pricing for premium placement. Book your spot before the early-bird deadline.","id":"E12","subject":"Last chance: booth discount!!!","time":"07:30","topic":"noise","thread_id":"spam-megaconf"}]
